pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 30
# Android only. Use a private state with MSAA initially 4X.
# Open Graphics and turn MSAA off; inspect the RESTART badge and pending note.
# Verify the saved choice after exit, then restart to check effective sampling.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
hostkey 240 f6
hostkey 300 down
hostkey 340 down
hostkey 380 enter
hostkey 420 down
hostkey 460 right
capture 520 msaa-setting
stop 3000
